    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="structllvm_1_1telemetry_1_1_telemetry_info" kindref="compound">TelemetryInfo</ref> is the data courier, used to move instrumented data from the tool being monitored to the Telemetry framework. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This base class contains only the basic set of telemetry data. Downstream implementations can define more subclasses with additional fields to describe different events and concepts.</para>
<para>For example, The LLDB debugger can define a DebugCommandInfo subclass which has additional fields about the debug-command being instrumented, such as <computeroutput>CommandArguments</computeroutput> or <computeroutput>CommandName</computeroutput>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
